      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and caring veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the entire team at Beechwood Veterinary Centre in Baillieston for their warmth, friendliness, and dedication. Longstanding pet owners who have visited for over a decade highlight receptionists and veterinary surgeons for making each appointment stress-free. Reviewers frequently note that the team goes the extra mile to assist pets and their owners."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling and anxious pet support"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners emphasize how gently and patiently their dogs and cats are treated during examinations and vaccinations. Reviewers with anxious or nervous animals appreciate that clinicians take extra time to soothe pets, offering treats and reassurance to ensure a calm experience. Clients describe feeling complete confidence leaving their animals in the hands of the clinical team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Informative guidance and open discussions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the clear, detailed explanations provided by the veterinarians regarding pet nutrition, vaccines, and treatment options. Clients note that clinicians take time to answer worries thoroughly and explain future health factors without rushing. Pet owners also value that treatment costs and estimates are discussed openly prior to procedures."
      }
    }
  ],
